# Canonical @spartan-ng/cli-generated kit directives — leave them in the generator's own
# class order so a re-sync doesn't fight prettier-plugin-tailwindcss.
#
# The negations below are load-bearing and fail SILENTLY if dropped. The old glob used the
# generator's own file prefix as the discriminator — generated code carried it, hand-authored
# code did not. #150 renamed both to `trn-*`, so that signal is gone and the hand-authored
# libs have to be named explicitly instead.
# Without them `pnpm format:check` does not fail — there is simply less to check, and the
# adapters drift unnoticed.
libs/kit/**/trn-*.ts
!libs/kit/overlay/**/trn-*.ts
!libs/kit/icon/**/trn-*.ts

.pnpm-store/
**/.pnpm-store/
